        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Religious freedom includes the right to worship without coercion.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "One key justification for separating church and state is the protection of religious free exercise.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Public governance requires the sovereignty of reason.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Effective public discourse must use a shared language that transcends religious divisions.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Public discourse should also transcend ethnic, racial, and gender-based divisions.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
