    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "I think that's right. I mean, I think David Hume captured that point. That's when he said when someone reports that God spoke to him in his dreams, what they're really saying is they had a dream that God spoke to them. I think that we can no more take it on the authority of somebody's dream that God told them what to do than we can take it on somebody's profession that God speaks to them while they're awake.",
