    "turn_idx": 85,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, you see a lot of that. You see a lot of misinformation out there. And unfortunately, people don't turn to scientific journals to get information about scientific issues. What they do is they turn to the media. They turn to popular internet sites who frankly get it wrong most of the time.",
