      {
        "text": "Defending science is a critical societal endeavor.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Particular interest groups may exploit societies that neglect reason and evidence.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Religious belief does not inherently conflict with science.",
