        "text": "Public policy should be grounded in objective truth accessible through empirical methods.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Reason and evidence-based inquiry are superior to dogma or unverified belief in shaping public decisions.",
        "confidence": 0.94
