    "turn_text": "And I agree with you that if we have the religious zealots and absolutists in charge of government all over the world, then we're going to have a very tough time dealing with the realities of climate change and the other environmental issues that are so serious that confront us, including the quality of our water, water shortages, droughts, toxic contamination of the land and so on.",
