    "turn_idx": 96,
    "turn_text": "Well, that's kind of an easy one. I hate to call climate change an easy issue, but compared to something like, let's say abortion, because with climate change, you could look at the science. We could look at science and say, yeah, 97% or whatever the statistic is these days, scientists fully agree that this is going on. But now when we're confronting an issue like abortion, it's difficult to point to any science to make a moral decision. So what are your thoughts on that?",
