    "turn_idx": 99,
    "turn_text": "Well, I introduced the assault weapon ban measure in the state of Maryland. And I introduced another provision in our comprehensive gun package, which passed two years ago. which required people to report a missing or lost or stolen gun. All of these provisions, of course, were opposed by the NRA forces. But to me, this is a basic tenant of a pro-human political philosophy. I mean, it's a scandal when you look at the thousands of Americans who die every year through gun violence and through gun accidents and through gun",
