        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The Second Amendment was written in a historical context where firearms were limited in technology and availability.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The Second Amendment protects the right to bear arms.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
