        "text": "Critical thinking involves testing positions by exploring extreme cases.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Historical context influences the interpretation of constitutional language.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The term 'arms' should be interpreted within practical and societal limits, not literally.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "It is morally unacceptable for individuals to have access to weapons capable of mass destruction.",
