  {
    "episode_id": 84720,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84720.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 109,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, and then again, I don't think there's a single Supreme Court justice who would assert that there is a categorical absolute right to own anything that qualifies as an arm, whether it's a handgun, a shotgun, an Uzi, a machine gun, or a nuclear weapon.",
