    "turn_idx": 111,
    "turn_text": "Yeah. The history is fascinating because the NRA itself used to be a very moderate balanced organization which was interested in gun safety and proper gun education. And it believed strongly in effective and reasonable regulation of firearms. And it got politicized and taken off in a very right-wing direction. And now it panders to some of the worst paranoia and fantasies in the country.",
